repository-code: https://github.com/AK-314/circuit-families
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code, data, selected model checkpoints, recorded analysis outputs, and
  reproduction materials accompanying “Grokking Opens a Family of Sparse
  Circuits.” The artifact supports integrity verification, independent
  recalculation of reported summaries, figure regeneration from source CSVs,
  checkpoint-level reevaluation, analysis reruns, and from-scratch model
  retraining under the specified procedure.
keywords:
  - grokking
  - mechanistic interpretability
